;;;; Copied from the original's emotion_chip/data/ (CC0 1.0, see NOTICE):
;;;; the 171 emotion concepts with their rendering group and arousal
;;;; bucket, the delivery words that are not concepts, the rendering
;;;; groups with the rate and stability they ask for, and the sounds a
;;;; score may name with the vendor spellings that alias them. Nothing
;;;; here measures a feeling; a word only picks the group a call renders
;;;; with.

